# ICC TEC IAC (primitive free "cipher") – Experimental Irreversible Approximate Stream Transformation
# Core Chaos Generation – Key-Based Prime Reciprocal Exponentiation
This is an experimental cryptographic / data transformation method based on deterministic algebraic chaos using transcendental functions, high-precision floating-point arithmetic, rotations in exotic algebras (including sedenions), and controlled accumulation of IEEE 754 rounding errors.

**Important: This is NOT a standard cryptographic primitive.**  
It is a highly specialized, irreversible approximate transformation that exploits the fundamental imperfections of real-world floating-point units.

